# ai-pharius - Project Overview

**AI + Alpharius** - personal Warhammer 40,000 **11th edition match-planning coach**.
GitHub Pages front door; Cloud Run API planned. Not a mid-game chatbot, not a rules-only arbiter.

> *I am Alpharius. This is a lie.*

Canonical design (mission, diagrams, reasoning philosophy): `docs/design.md`.
Phased delivery: `docs/plan_of_travel.md`.

